  "details": "Avatar search is a very big thing for me as finding avatars in worlds is very difficult and takes a lot of time.\nSomething to highlight everyone in the world so that it's easy to find where my friends are and i don't have to go searching the whole map.\nNotifications of who joined the world i'm in, super helpful to know when friends join on you, otherwise they might just think i'm ignoring them and leave.\nAdd some sort of list that displays everyone in the room where i can mute etc. from because i struggle to click on people sometimes when they're constantly moving.",
